{
  "id": "6a7759facc64e78eac2d66d0",
  "title": "学習に適した感情",
  "created": 1786206715,
  "updated": 1786208768,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6a7759facc64e78eac2d66d0",
      "text": "学習に適した感情",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206790
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbf9d",
      "text": "from [2026/08/08]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fe00000000002fbfa7",
      "text": "[Summer498.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206718,
      "updated": 1786206725
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbf9e",
      "text": "[学習]に適した[感情]を探している",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbf9f",
      "text": "\t疲れているときは学習しても頭に入らない",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbfa0",
      "text": "\tドパっているときは高速でテストを回せるが、[反省]が難しい",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbfa1",
      "text": "\t疲れていない　かつ　落ち着いているときは落ち着いて本を読める",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a775aab00000000002fbfaa",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206891,
      "updated": 1786206891
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbfa2",
      "text": "フィードバックを受け入れるための[感情解釈]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206895
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbfa3",
      "text": "\t「それ間違ってるよ」に対する[不快感]を「[悔しさ]」と定義して「アァ！？悔しいなァ！もう一回！」とする",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206811
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbfa4",
      "text": "\t何考えていても良いが高速で[学習サイクル]を回し続けることが重要なので、次のサイクルを回しやすい[考え方]を身につけると良い",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbfa5",
      "text": "\t イイね[taktamur.icon]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7759fb00000000002fbfa6",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206715,
      "updated": 1786206715
    },
    {
      "id": "6a775a5e00000000002fbfa9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786206814,
      "updated": 1786206814
    },
    {
      "id": "6a77602500000000002fbfc1",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1786208294,
      "updated": 1786208294
    },
    {
